invariant: INV-41
file: Makefile
catches: test/widemul-builds.sh
reason: make writes CH_RSA_IFMA_MODEL for every host object, so rsa_ifma.c
  would read test/rsa_ifma_model_lanes.h, the scalar model of each
  instruction, in place of the AVX-512 instructions, and a session with
  CH_CPU_AVX512_IFMA would run test code that no library build may hold.
  test/widemul-builds.sh refuses a host object's defines that name it.

--- old
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF))
--- new
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF) $(if $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF),-DCH_RSA_IFMA_MODEL))
